style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eHave you ever used Tweetdeck before? Nope.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eHave you ever marketed something using twitter before? \u0026nbsp;Yup\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat changes would you like to see made on the Twitter team? I am not sure of what changes I would like to see, the team spirit really is great, I don't think that we need any changes!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eHow active are you/how is your work ethic? \u0026nbsp;I am really active and can do lots of stuff in a short amount of time!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou will have access to the official Twitter account and learn the basics of marketing from the standpoint of the platform. This is a great job for beginners that just want to learn.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\